    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a fast-paced retro arcade adventure with <strong>Eggbert</strong>, a daring red bird on a mission! In this classic-style platformer your goal is simple\u2014but far from easy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd5a <strong>Collect eggs</strong> that randomly appear across the level.<br>\ud83e\udd8a <strong>Avoid the cunning foxes</strong> that get faster and more relentless over time.<br>\ud83d\udc23 <strong>Hold onto the eggs</strong> until they hatch to earn points and climb the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With pixel-perfect platforming, increasing difficulty, and that addictive &quot;just one more try&quot; feel, Eggbert delivers the perfect blend of nostalgia and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you outsmart the foxes and become the ultimate egg-hatching champion?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a fast-paced retro arcade adventure with <strong>Eggbert</strong>, a daring red bird on a mission! In this classic-style platformer your goal is simple\u2014but far from easy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd5a <strong>Collect eggs</strong> that randomly appear across the level.<br>\ud83e\udd8a <strong>Avoid the cunning foxes</strong> that get faster and more relentless over time.<br>\ud83d\udc23 <strong>Hold onto the eggs</strong> until they hatch to earn points and climb the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With pixel-perfect platforming, increasing difficulty, and that addictive &quot;just one more try&quot; feel, Eggbert delivers the perfect blend of nostalgia and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you outsmart the foxes and become the ultimate egg-hatching champion?</p>",
